  public override string Help=>"PARADE PANDEMONIUM\nDrive into the marked cartoon targets. Blue +10 badges: 10 points. Gold shirts / stars: 100 points. Red STOP / cross badges: −100 points. Roles never depend on character appearance.\n\nOne score per pedestrian, credited to the first meaningful physical truck impact. Fallen bodies never score again. Scores can be negative. Three minutes, or clear every positive target. Surviving red targets do not prevent completion. Ties share placing.\n\nChoose shared arena, split chase or driver cab. Up to four humans and eight total competitors. Movement alone plays the sport. Reverse brakes before reversing. Cab: whole pad right stick; primary keyboard hold right mouse to look, middle click recenters. Shared sticks retain independent driving.\n\nEsc / Start pauses. Reconnect or explicitly replace a missing device, release inputs, then freshly resume. Rematch retains your names, colors and sources. Results offer optional multi-angle slow/fast impact highlights.";
